      "incircle_maps_to_line: incircle maps to line 2(Q-F)·(I-F) = k²",
      "ninePointCircle_maps_to_line: nine-point circle maps to line 2(Q-F)·(N-F) = k²",
      "feuerbach_normals_proportional: N-F = -(R/r)·(I-F)",
      "feuerbach_inversive_parallel_lines: the two image lines are parallel"
